# Raw local source images for the static-ad template importer (PART 3/4).
# This is only ever an IMPORT SOURCE for
# scripts/brandee-import-static-templates.js — never referenced by the
# running app (the app serves optimized copies from
# public/agents/brandee/assets/templates/imported/ instead, which IS
# committed). Keeping the raw originals out of git avoids bloating the repo
# with ~38MB of source photos that have no runtime purpose.
/Assets/

# AIO100 gateway config snapshots (Dinstar proprietary binary) and the vendor
# manual. Kept on disk in backups/aio100/ as restore points, but deliberately
# NOT committed: they are opaque blobs git cannot diff, they encode the SIP
# and network setup, and the manual is 6.3MB of vendor PDF.
# If the gateway config is ever lost, restore from backups/aio100/ — and keep
# a copy off this machine, since git is no longer the safety net for them.
*.bin
backups/
AIO100-1V-User-Manual.pdf
output/
tmp/
local-runtime/

# Customer-uploaded media. Real files, not source — kept out of git.
public/media/
